     * batch was worth writing rather than lightly editing: on 1 July 2026 the
     * EU removed the EUR 150 customs-duty exemption on low-value consignments
     * and put a flat interim duty in its place until 1 July 2028. Every source
     * article on this subject describes the world before that.
     *
     * Deliberately no attempt to quote what a given parcel will cost. The duty
     * is per tariff line, the carrier's handling charge is the carrier's, and
     * both are exactly the sort of number this file does not print.
